msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce this record's integrity condition over gmeow:InhabitationTenure; the record is the canonical carrier the gate joins."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须在 gmeow:InhabitationTenure 上强制该记录的完整性条件时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inhabitationIntervalFrameRequirement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when gmeow:InhabitationTenure no longer bears the condition — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当 gmeow:InhabitationTenure 不再承载该条件时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inhabitationIntervalFrameRequirement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read the record's own logic: fields together: they name gmeow:InhabitationTenure and the condition asserted over it, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching axiom from them."
msgstr "请一并阅读该记录自身的 logic: 字段：它们命名了 gmeow:InhabitationTenure 以及对其断言的条件，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应公理。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inhabitationIntervalFrameRequirement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:inhabitationIntervalFrameRequirement logic:characterizes gmeow:InhabitationTenure ."
msgstr "gmeow:inhabitationIntervalFrameRequirement logic:characterizes gmeow:InhabitationTenure ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/configurationEmbodimentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:configurationEmbodiment and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:configurationEmbodiment (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:configurationEmbodiment 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:configurationEmbodiment 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

